<title>USA: Electronic Tele-Comm tests Digicept.</title>
<headline>Electronic Tele-Comm tests Digicept.</headline>
<dateline>WAUKESHA, Wis. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electronic Tele-Communications Inc said Monday that three major telecommunications switch manufacturers have successfully tested its Digicept 2002 and 2000 products.</p>
<p>The products, which deliver voice announcements and services through public and private telephone networks, were successfully used with each manufacturer's switch product lines, the company said.</p>
<p>Electronics Tele-Communications supplies voice application processing platforms to telephone utilities, and messaging equipment to the commercial market.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
